Profile: MedicationIE
Parent: http://hl7.eu/fhir/base/StructureDefinition/medication-eu-core
Id: medication-ie
Title: "Medication (FHIR Core Ireland)"
Description: "Unmodified national constraint of the HL7 Europe Core Medication profile, reused as-is as no Irish-specific
requirement has yet been identified for this resource in v0.1. Retained as an explicit profile so downstream Irish profiles
(e.g. MedicationRequestIE) have a stable national canonical to reference."
